chunks.text:
[Battle] {a driving battle groove from the very first beat: violins and violas sawing a spiccato ostinato in sixteenths}
{cellos and contrabasses hammering eighths, bass drum, taiko and timpani on every beat, a snare on the off-beats}
{low brass and trombone stabs on the accents, an orchestra hit with a crash every fourth bar}
{a dark trumpet and horn theme over it, answered by the trombones}

[Battle, rising] {the same drive and the same instruments, no let-up}
{the theme on full brass, a choir holding chords under it, more hits, tom fills into every phrase}
{full energy to the last beat, as if it will run on into the start again}
